    "Serialised workflow graph shapes (nodes, links, groups, reroutes, extra) stay compatible with existing workflows.",
    "Extension-facing LGraph, LGraphNode, LLink, Reroute, LGraphGroup, and slot callbacks and fields keep their current behaviour; changes need ecosystem migration guidance.",
